&lt;p&gt;First, understand what the Skill should do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ask clarifying questions&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>